        'Tile roofing is the definitive architectural hallmark of Southern California, adorning luxury residences from Rancho Santa Fe and La Jolla to master-planned communities across Carlsbad, Chula Vista, and Poway. As a dedicated tile roofing company in San Diego, Rise Up Roofing & Construction specializes in concrete tile, flat modern shake tiles, and historic Spanish terracotta clay roof tiles. While concrete and clay tiles are exceptionally durable—often lasting 50 to 100 years—the organic asphalt felt paper installed beneath them typically degrades, cracks, and deteriorates after just 18 to 25 years under intense San Diego ultraviolet rays and thermal expansion cycles. When water penetrates beneath slipped or cracked tiles, rotted felt paper allows rainwater to soak directly into plywood decking and ceilings.',
